	<p>
		This privacy policy explains how <strong>The Wrist Journal</strong> (thewristjournal.com) handles information when you visit the site.
	</p>

	<h2>Information You Provide</h2>

	<p>
		The Wrist Journal does not require you to create an account or submit personal information to read the site. If you contact us by email, the information you include in that message is used to respond to your enquiry.
	</p>

	<h2>Analytics</h2>

	<p>
		The site uses Google Analytics to understand how visitors use The Wrist Journal, such as which pages are visited and how people arrive at the site. This information helps us understand what readers find useful and improve the website. Google may process information such as device, browser, approximate location, and IP-related data according to its own policies.
	</p>

	<p>
		You can learn more about Google's privacy practices at <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a>. Google also provides a <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Cookies and Advertising</h2>

	<p>
		The Wrist Journal may use advertising services such as Google AdSense. Advertising providers may use cookies or similar technologies to serve, measure, and personalise ads where permitted. Google's advertising practices are explained in its <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Advertising Policies</a>.
	</p>

	<p>
		You can manage personalised advertising through <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>. Your browser may also provide controls for blocking or deleting cookies.
	</p>

	<h2>Affiliate Links</h2>

	<p>
		Some links on The Wrist Journal are affiliate links. If you make a purchase through one of these links, the site may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. The Wrist Journal participates in the Amazon Associates programme. As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases.
	</p>

	<p>
		You can read the full <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for more information.
	</p>

	<h2>External Websites</h2>

	<p>
		Articles may link to retailers, manufacturers, social networks, and other external websites. The Wrist Journal is not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those sites. Their own privacy policies apply when you visit them.
	</p>

	<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>

	<p>
		This policy may be updated as the site or the services it uses change. The latest update date will be shown on this page.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact</h2>

	<p>
		Questions about this privacy policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:arjundashrath@gmail.com">arjundashrath@gmail.com</a>.
	</p>

